    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA wonderful opportunity has arisen to acquire a superb part red brick, semi-detached family residence situated in a mature and sought after residential location convenient to local shopping facilities the scenic Broadmeadow Estuary, Malahide village with all its restaurants, boutiques, schools and the DART station. Situated in a quiet cul de sac the property provides excellent family accommodation throughout comprising of a lounge, dining room, separate family room to the side and a large kitchen, there is a guest WC off the entrance hall and upstairs there are three spacious bedrooms and a family bathroom. \n\nThe space above the garage conversion and to the rear of the property offers enormous potetnial to expand the overall space of the home. (subject to the relevant PP) To the front a driveway provides off street parking and to the rear is a completely private west facing rear garden, mainly in lawn. Viewing is essential to appreciate this family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.44m x 1.75m\nWooden flooring, understairs storage.\n\nWc - 1.44m x 0.78m\nFully tiled floor, whb, wc.\n\nLounge - 4.44m x 3.65m\nWooden flooring, coving on ceiling, fireplace.\n\nPlayroom - 4.38m x 2.38m\nGarage conversion\n\nKitchen - 5.05m x 3.43m\nFully fitted kitchen with excellent range of wall and floor units. Electric oven. Fully tiled floor. Sliding door to rear garden.\n\nDining room - 3.36m x 2.97m\nWooden flooring. Sliding door to rear garden. Coving on ceiling.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.46m x 3.08m\nTo rear: Carpeted floor, built in sliderobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.16m x 3.51m\nTo front: Solid wooden floor, built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 2.68m\nTo front: Carpeted floor. Wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.17m x 1.96m\nFully tiled floor, fully tiled walls. Built in storage, whb, wc, shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Semi-detached three bed family home </li><li>Highly desirable cul de sac location </li><li>Within walking distance of Malahide village and Broadmeadow Estuary </li><li>Completely private west facing rear garden </li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>Family room to side</ul>"
      },
